{"body": [{"y0": 67.8, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 202.6, "text": "PENSVM B"}, {"y0": 81.6, "x0": 150.2, "x1": 404.9, "text": "Quintus — dé lupó et — audire non vult nec fabulam dé"}, {"y0": 95.5, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 405.3, "text": "Achille, qui Hectorem — et corpus eius mortuum post —"}, {"y0": 109.4, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 311.7, "text": "suum circum — [- müroós] Troiae —."}, {"y0": 123.4, "x0": 160.1, "x1": 405.1, "text": "Labyrinthus est magnum — unde nemó exire potest, etsi"}, {"y0": 137.4, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 404.9, "text": "ianua —. Théseus, qui patrem Minotauri, — album, iam"}, {"y0": 151.5, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 404.2, "text": "necàverat, Minótaurum ipsum quoque — [- interficere] —."}, {"y0": 165.2, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 404.4, "text": "Antequam Théseus, ad pugnam —-, labyrinthum intrávit,"}, {"y0": 179.0, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 405.3, "text": "Ariadna, filia —, ei — longum dedit. Ita Ariadna Theseo —"}, {"y0": 193.1, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 405.1, "text": "tulit, nam ille filum sequens — labyrinthi repperit. Post —"}, {"y0": 207.1, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 405.1, "text": "Minótauri Théseus cum Ariadnà Naxum nàvigàavit atque —"}, {"y0": 221.1, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 404.4, "text": "[7 illic] eam — (2 reliquit]. Ariadna ab alto — prospiciébat,"}, {"y0": 235.0, "x0": 150.0, "x1": 404.7, "text": "sed — [2 mox] navis Thesei & — eius abiit. Puella misera in"}, {"y0": 248.9, "x0": 149.3, "x1": 404.7, "text": "— déscendit, ubi — et — curréns capillum scindébat, ut"}, {"y0": 262.5, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 404.7, "text": "faciunt eae quae —. Théseus post — patris multos annos"}, {"y0": 276.6, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 199.5, "text": "Athénàs —."}, {"y0": 304.3, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 202.8, "text": "PENSVM C"}, {"y0": 318.3, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 233.4, "text": "Quid fecit Achillés?"}, {"y0": 332.2, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 238.1, "text": "Quid fécit Romulus?"}, {"y0": 345.7, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 315.8, "text": "Qualem fabulam Quintus audire cupit?"}, {"y0": 359.7, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 264.2, "text": "Ubi habitàbat Minótaurus?"}, {"y0": 374.0, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 241.3, "text": "Quid est labyrinthus?"}, {"y0": 387.8, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 258.2, "text": "Quid Minotaurus edébat?"}, {"y0": 401.5, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 326.1, "text": "Cür tot Atheniénsés ad eum mittebantur?"}, {"y0": 415.5, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 318.7, "text": "Quis Athénienses à Minotauró servàvit?"}, {"y0": 429.2, "x0": 149.7, "x1": 347.3, "text": "Quómodo Théseus exitum labyrinthi repperit?"}, {"y0": 443.3, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 314.6, "text": "Solusne Theseus & Crétà profectus est?"}, {"y0": 457.5, "x0": 149.5, "x1": 286.8, "text": "Ubi Theseus Ariadnam reliquit?"}, {"y0": 469.7, "x0": 149.1, "x1": 305.2, "text": "À quó mare Aegaeum nómen habet?"}], "margin": [{"y0": 69.4, "x0": 48.7, "x1": 59.7, "text": "rTéX"}, {"y0": 78.0, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 87.8, "text": "expugnàtio"}, {"y0": 86.9, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 68.7, "text": "gloria"}, {"y0": 95.9, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 79.9, "text": "auxilium"}, {"y0": 105.0, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 64.4, "text": "civis"}, {"y0": 114.0, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 69.2, "text": "exitus"}, {"y0": 122.9, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 67.3, "text": "filum"}, {"y0": 134.2, "x0": 48.5, "x1": 66.5, "text": "mora"}, {"y0": 143.4, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 60.8, "text": "nex"}, {"y0": 150.6, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 63.3, "text": "litus"}, {"y0": 161.6, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 71.0, "text": "saxum"}, {"y0": 169.5, "x0": 48.4, "x1": 87.1, "text": "conspectus"}, {"y0": 177.9, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 80.2, "text": "cupiditàs"}, {"y0": 187.1, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 76.1, "text": "nàrràtió"}, {"y0": 195.9, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 74.6, "text": "humilis"}, {"y0": 205.1, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 74.8, "text": "timidus"}, {"y0": 214.5, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 78.1, "text": "terribilis"}, {"y0": 223.7, "x0": 48.2, "x1": 79.3, "text": "miràbilis"}, {"y0": 234.6, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 70.7, "text": "saevus"}, {"y0": 241.8, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 75.9, "text": "cupidus"}, {"y0": 251.4, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 74.1, "text": "paratus"}, {"y0": 261.6, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 69.8, "text": "regere"}, {"y0": 268.7, "x0": 48.0, "x1": 73.0, "